ne, parmesan, croutons and our classic dressing.",price:10,image:Ye.salad,category:"Sides & Fries"},{id:4,name:"Margherita Pizza",description:"Fresh mozzarella, tomato sauce, basil and extra virgin olive oil.",price:12,image:Ye.pizza,category:"Combo Meals"},{id:5,name:"The Perfect Combo",description:"Our signature cheeseburger, golden fries and a refreshing drink.",price:17,image:Ye.burger,category:"Combo Meals"},{id:6,name:"Garden Club Sandwich",description:"Toasted artisan bread, seasonal greens and our house dressing.",price:11,image:Ye.sandwich,category:"Sandwich"},{id:7,name:"Golden Seasoned Fries",description:"Perfectly crisp, lightly salted and made for sharing.",price:5,image:Ye.fries,category:"Sides & Fries"},{id:8,name:"Little Lover’s Burger",description:"A little cheeseburger with a side of big smiles and golden fries.",price:8,image:Ye.burger,category:"Kids’ Meals"},{id:9,name:"Fresh Citrus Cooler",description:"Freshly squeezed citrus, sparkling water and a little sunshine.",price:5,image:Ye.drink,category:"Beverages"}],q0=["Combo Meals","Pasta","Burger","Sandwich","Sides & Fries","Kids’ Meals","Beverages"],$u=["Home","Menu","About","Blog","Contact"],$d=[{name:"Armas Rosie",text:"Absolutely amazing food! The flavors are incredible and the service is top-notch.",avatar:"https://i.pravatar.cc/80?img=12",detail:"A new favorite in the neighborhood. The cheeseburger was perfectly cooked, and the team made us feel right at home."},{name:"Sophia Williams",text:"Fresh ingredients, great taste, and fast delivery. I’ll definitely order again!",avatar:"https://i.pravatar.cc/80?img=47",detail:"Everything arrived warm and beautifully prepared. You can really taste the care in every ingredient."},{name:"David Miller",text:"The best burger I’ve had in ages. Perfectly cooked and full of flavor.",avatar:"https://i.pravatar.cc/80?img=13",detail:"Came for a quick lunch, stayed for dessert. An easy five stars for the food and the friendly service."},{name:"Olivia Bennett",text:"A wonderful experience from start to finish. Highly recommended!",avatar:"https://i.pravatar.cc/80?img=44",detail:"We celebrated a birthday here and couldn’t have chosen a better place. Such a lovely, relaxed atmosphere."}],Wd=[{title:"The Art of Perfect Pasta",date:"AUGUST 24, 2026",image:Ye.pasta,excerpt:"Discover the secrets behind creating authentic Italian pasta at home.",body:["Great pasta starts with simple ingredients and a little patience. Choose a quality pasta, a generous pot of salted water, and fresh seasonal produce. Let each ingredient have its moment.","Cook your pasta just shy of al dente, then finish it in the sauce. A splash of starchy pasta water brings everything together, creating that beautiful silky texture without weighing the dish down.","At Food Lover, we finish every bowl with freshly grated parmesan, fragrant herbs and a generous helping of love. Pull up a chair. There’s always room at our table."]},{title:"5 Burger Recipes You’ll Love",date:"AUGUST 24, 2026",image:Ye.burger,excerpt:"From classic to gourmet, explore our top 5 burger recipes.",body:["The classic cheeseburger will always have our hearts: a well-seared patty, melting cheddar and a toasted brioche bun. But a great burger is also an invitation to get creative.","Try a mushroom and Swiss combination, a smoky barbecue burger, a spicy jalapeño melt, or a fresh garden burger with a chickpea patty. Keep toppings balanced so every bite has a little of everything.","Our secret? Fresh ingredients, a hot grill and never pressing down on the patty. Visit us to find your new favorite, or bring a little Food Lover inspiration to your own kitchen."]},{title:"Healthy Eating, Happy Living",date:"AUGUST 31, 2026",image:Ye.salad,excerpt:"Simple tips and delicious recipes for a healthier lifestyle.",body:["Eating well should feel like a pleasure, not a chore. Start with colorful seasonal vegetables, add a satisfying protein and finish with a dressing you love.","Our Caesar salad brings together crisp greens, crunchy croutons and freshly shaved parmesan. It’s proof that fresh, simple ingredients can become something truly memorable.","Make space for the foods that make you happy, enjoy meals with people you love, and listen to your appetite. Good food is about nourishment, connection and a little everyday joy."]}],_n=m=>`$${m.toFixed(2)}`;function R0({title:m,children:x,onClose:U,drawer:o=!1}){const R=J.useRef(null),Y=J.useId();return J.useEffect(()=>{const q=document.activeElement,W=document.body.style.overflow;document.body.style.overflow="hidden";const D=R.current;D?.querySelector("button, input, a[href]")?.focus();const z=N=>{if(N.key==="Escape"&&U(),N.key==="Tab"){const _=D?.querySelectorAll('button:not(:disabled), a[href], input, textarea, [tabindex="0"]');if(!_?.length)return;const Q=_[0],Z=_[_.length-1];N.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===Q?(N.preventDefault(),Z.focus()):!N.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===Z&&(N.preventDefault(),Q.focus())}};return document.addEventListener("keydown",z),()=>{document.body.style.overflow=W,document.removeEventListener("keydown",z),q?.focus()}},[U]),c.jsx("div",{className:`modal-backdrop ${o?"drawer-backdrop":""}`,onMouseDown:q=>{q.target===q.currentTarget&&U()},children:c.jsxs("div",{ref:R,role:"dialog","aria-modal":"true","aria-labelledby":Y,className:o?"drawer":"modal",children:[c.jsxs("div",{className:"modal-heading",children:[c.jsx("h2",{id:Y,children:m}),c.jsx("button",{className:"icon-button",onClick:U,"aria-label":"Close dialog",children:c.jsx(Fu,{size:22})})]}),x]})})}function Fd({id:m,label:x,value:U,options:o,onChange:R,error:Y}){const[q,W]=J.useState(!1),[D,z]=J.useState(0),N=J.useRef(null),_=J.useRef(null);J.useEffect(()=>{const Z=$=>{N.current?.contains($.target)||W(!1)};return document.addEventListener("mousedown",Z),()=>document.removeEventListener("mousedown",Z)},[]),J.useEffect(()=>{q&&N.current?.querySelector(`[data-option="${D}"]`)?.scrollIntoView({block:"nearest"})},[q,D]);const Q=Z=>{R(